※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4283 LANG_ALTERNATIVES_NOT_A_SUM

※ `⎕alternatives` takes a sum apart; a record holds all its fields at once, which is
※ what `⎕fields` answers.

let std := ⎕import("std")

type Point = x : u8 ; y : u8

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    let p: Point = Point(.x ← 1u8, .y ← 2u8)
    let n: mut u8 = 0u8
    comptime foreach a := ⎕alternatives(p):
        n ← n + 1u8
    if n = 0u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
